Saya bisa membuktikan

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.760
Dia bukan Li Yuan'er.

00:07:44.875 --> 00:07:46.519
(Cermin Keadilan Tergantung Tinggi)

00:07:46.519 --> 00:07:47.359
Tuan Cui.

